                  "text": "• Developed a Full Stack application for creating, managing, and playing Chess online.\n• Designed responsive user interface in React and utilized Redux to manage the state of the application.\n• Enabled real-time gameplay between two users by utilizing Websockets implemented inside a NodeJS microservice.\n• Integrated algorithm to auto-generate pairing for each round according to the Swiss System.\n• Created web services in Spring Boot and utilized Spring Data JPA to persist data into MySQL"
